  "worked_solution": "The formula for the derivative of $\\text{arccot}$ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\text{arccot\u00a0}x)=-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{\u2032}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\text{arccot\u00a0}x+\\operatorname{ln}\u2061({x}^{2}+1)) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}+\\frac{2x}{{x}^{2}+1} \\\\  & =\\frac{2x-1}{{x}^{2}+1}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
